[{"id":"CN-MOD-008","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTPS","边界","回退"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不能把“HTTPS”“HTTP/3”“端到端加密”当成同义词？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>HTTPS 是 HTTP over TLS，HTTP/3 是 HTTP 语义 over QUIC，TLS 可能在反向代理终止；协议能力、传输版本和部署拓扑是不同维度。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/3 可以回退到 HTTP/2，HTTPS 不自动提供业务授权，也不保证所有链路节点都不解密。回答应说明具体链路和终止点。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把现代协议的职责拆开：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>层\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>负责什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>UDP\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>提供可控的数据报封装入口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>QUIC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>连接 ID、确认、丢包恢复、拥塞控制、独立流和 TLS\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP/3\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>把 HTTP 语义映射到 QUIC\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>QPACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>压缩 HTTP 字段\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>所以“使用 UDP”不能推出“没有连接、可靠性或加密”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["UDP","TCP","性能"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":17,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>UDP 一定比 TCP 快吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不一定。UDP 少了部分机制，但应用可能重新实现可靠性、拥塞控制和加密；实际性能受 RTT、丢包、编码、排队和实现影响。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>应比较完整协议栈的目标和测量结果，而不是只比较传输层协议名称。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先看协议提供的边界，再讨论性能：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>能力\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>UDP\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>TCP\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>数据报边界\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>保留\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不保留，只有字节流\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>重传/排序\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用决定\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>协议提供\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>拥塞控制\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用或上层决定\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>协议提供\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>UDP 少的是机制，不是“更快”的保证；如果应用补回可靠性、加密和拥塞控制，比较对象就已经变成完整协议栈。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-stream-disconnect","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["断线","清理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信","articlePath":"posts/6be6843f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信","articlePath":"posts/6be6843f/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>流式响应断开时必须清理什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>清理生成器持有的数据库会话、订阅、文件和队列，并保存最后一个成功发送的游标。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>客户端断开会让后续发送失败或触发取消；如果没有 \u003ccode>finally\u003c/code>，资源会一直占用，重连还可能重复发送。将游标写入事件 ID 或外部状态，重连用 \u003ccode>Last-Event-ID\u003c/code> 恢复；若没有可重放历史，就明确返回快照重置，而不是假装无损续传。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-path-hash","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["PATH","缓存"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>修改 PATH 后仍执行旧版本命令，应该先检查什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>检查 type -a name 和 PATH，再运行 hash -r 清除 Bash 的外部命令缓存。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Shell 会把已经找到的外部命令路径暂存在 hash 表中。可以用最小实验确认顺序：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a python\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;PATH=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$PATH\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">hash\u003c/span> -t python 2&gt;/dev/null || \u003cspan class=\"literal\">true\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">hash\u003c/span> -r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a python\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>hash -r\u003c/code> 只清掉缓存，不会修复权限、缺失文件或错误的 \u003ccode>PATH\u003c/code> 顺序；清缓存后仍要检查最终路径和 \u003ccode>--version\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytester-inprocess-subprocess","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["插件测试"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/76bdbbc7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/76bdbbc7/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>pytester 的进程内与子进程运行应如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>进程内适合快速检查输出和结果对象；子进程更能验证真实插件发现、导入、环境和退出码。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>进程内模式和子进程模式观察的边界不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>模式\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>能证明什么\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>典型断言\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>runpytest\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前 Python 进程中的插件行为\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结果对象、收集数量\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>runpytest_subprocess\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>真实导入、配置、环境和退出码\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Node ID、退出状态、日志\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>只要问题涉及 \u003ccode>conftest.py\u003c/code>、配置文件、环境变量或 entry point，就优先子进程。两种模式都应断言收集数量、失败节点和退出码，不能把标准输出中偶然出现一句文字当成插件测试通过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]